Project-Development
ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
Project Development
1. Development Overview
The development of ComicCraft focuses on implementing an AI-powered system that converts a user's simple story idea into a structured comic.
The development process follows:
User Idea
   ↓
Story Generation
   ↓
Character Generation
   ↓
Scene Generation
   ↓
Panel Generation
   ↓
Dialogue & Narration
   ↓
Artwork Generation
   ↓
Comic Editing
   ↓
Preview & Export
________________________________________
2. Development Environment
Frontend
A modern web framework such as React or Next.js can be used to develop:
•	Landing page
•	Login/register
•	Dashboard
•	Comic creation form
•	Story editor
•	Character editor
•	Panel editor
•	Comic preview
Backend
A backend using Node.js/Express or Python/FastAPI can handle:
•	API requests
•	Authentication
•	Gemini integration
•	Database operations
•	Project management
•	AI response validation
•	Export processing
AI
Google Gemini models can be integrated for:
•	Story generation
•	Character generation
•	Scene generation
•	Dialogue generation
•	Panel descriptions
•	Visual prompt generation
Database
A database such as PostgreSQL, MongoDB, or Firebase can store:
•	User accounts
•	Comic projects
•	Stories
•	Characters
•	Scenes
•	Panels
•	Generated assets
