18. Error Handling
The application should handle situations such as:
•	Empty prompts
•	Invalid user input
•	Gemini API errors
•	API quota limits
•	Network failures
•	Invalid AI responses
•	Image-generation failures
•	Database failures
Example:
AI Generation Failed
        │
        ▼
Show Error Message
        │
        ├── Retry
        └── Continue Editing
Existing user work should not be deleted when an AI request fails.
